PI.md","line":40},{"title":"lazy\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":44},{"title":"of\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":45},{"title":"empty\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":46},{"title":"GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordScopedAPI.md","line":48},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":54},{"title":"Stream","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":54},{"title":"aggregate","target":"r_Aggregate","line":64},{"title":"get\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":84},{"title":"orElse\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":85},{"title":"ifPresent\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":86},{"title":"isEmpty\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":87},{"title":"isPresent\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md","line":88},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":90},{"title":"GlideQuery","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideQueryGlobalAPI.md","line":340},{"title":"Stream","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/StreamGlobalAPI.md","line":340},{"title":"aggregate","target":"r_Aggregate","line":494}],"metadata":{"title":"Optional - Scoped, Global","description":"The Optional API interacts with a single record returned by the GlideQuery, Stream, or GlideRecord APIs, even when it does not exist. Write scripts that are less likely to result in an error by handling null or undefined query results.Returns an empty Optional object. Use this method in an Else clause to handle a query that might not return a result.Applies a predicate function, a function that takes a single value and returns true or false, to the record inside the Optional object. If the function returns true, the method returns the Optional record unchanged. If the function returns false, it returns an empty Optional object.Applies a function that returns an Optional object to the result of a query. Use this method to perform a second query using the result of the first.Returns the record inside the Optional object, or throws an error if the query does not return a record.Applies a function to the record within an Optional object. If the Optional object does not contain a record, the function does not execute.Returns true if the Optional object is empty.Checks whether an Optional object contains a value.Returns a new Optional object. Instead of containing the record, the object contains a function to get the record that is only called if and when requested in the code.Applies a function to the result of a query.Wraps a given value in an Optional object. For example, you can wrap the result of a GlideRecord query in an Optional object to use the associated methods.Adds a default value within the Optional object if the query does not return any results.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":10,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[60,70],[74,78],[108,120],[124,126],[142,148],[164,173],[177,186],[202,208],[212,217],[233,240],[274,281],[285,287],[321,328],[332,334],[368,377],[386,390],[392,408],[417,421],[423,441],[453,457],[459,475],[481,485]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/OptionalGlobalAPI.md"},
